Service Proposal Manager
========================
**Your focus is to develop and support the selling of service contracts to the existing and future gas turbine \& combined cycle customers around the globe.**
**Your tasks:**
* Lead the tendering activities for competitive offers for Service Contracts of all types, e.g. long term maintenance agreements, frame agreements, upgrades;
* Support the development \& alignment of the offer strategy, addressing market \& customer considerations, with other stakeholder, e.g. new equipment business \& other partner units in the global Ansaldo network;
* Ensure that the offers meet the Ansaldo guidelines for such activities \& co\-lead the review process;
* Support the negotiation \& closing of contracts with the customer;
* Support market \& competitive intelligence know\-how build\-up in a structured \& effective manner;
* Take an active part in improving \& maintaining the process \& tools landscape used in the activities.
**Your profile**
* Degree in mechanical engineering and/or business studies with a good technical understanding;
* Experience from the industrial sector, preferably power industry with a well proven track record is an advantage;
* Experience in international tendering or sales is a plus;
* Open minded, willing to learn \& having endurance through the offer \& sales cycle;
* Being flexible \& willing to travel globally, also on short notice (approx. 10% of the time);
* Critical thinking, problem solving \& analytical skills;
* Strong commitment to delivery on\-time/\-cost;
* Excellent command of English, \& French, other languages are an advantage, further knowledge of Italian would be an asset.

* Working with passionate people;
* Participating in environmental sustainability;
* Challenging work;
* Attractive and exciting products;
* Interaction with international colleagues;
* Flexible working conditions;
* Place of work in a beautiful small city rich in culture and history in the heart of Switzerland, close to the metropoles like Zurich and Basel.
**If you are interested in a future\-oriented company, take the chance and apply to this exiting position through our company job portal ( ). We’re looking forward to receiving your application!**
